5. Pricing & Subscription
================================================================================

Free Tier

New users receive 5 free conversions per day for Calculation Views with 1–10 nodes. No credit card or signup is required to start converting!

Credit System

Our transparent credit system is based on the number of nodes in your HANA Calculation View, where 1 Credit = $1.

Node-Based Pricing:
• 1–10 Nodes: 10 credits
• 10–20 Nodes: 10 credits  
• 20–40 Nodes: 20 credits
• 40+ Nodes: 30 credits

Note: Paid conversions are only required for files exceeding the free tier limits. Files with 10 or fewer nodes always qualify for free conversion (subject to daily limit).

Purchased credits do not expire. You can easily purchase more credits at any time through your profile settings. For Enterprise solutions, contact us for custom pricing.

