7. Troubleshooting & FAQ
================================================================================

Common Questions:

Q: Will HANACV2SQL convert each node to a CTE as-is?
A: No. Mapping each node to a separate CTE may work, but it's not the most performant or industry-standard approach. Our tool intelligently optimizes the SQL by reducing the number of nodes wherever possible, generating highly efficient and performant SQL.

Q: How accurate is the conversion process?
A: Our conversion engine achieves 95% accuracy for most standard Calculation Views. Complex custom calculations or very specialized HANA functions may require minor manual adjustments, which our tool will highlight for you.

Q: Is my data secure during the conversion process?
A: Yes! Your raw XML files are never stored and are deleted right after conversion. Only your converted files are safely kept in the cloud, so you can access them anytime in the future. Your privacy and data security are our top priority.

Q: What output formats are supported?
A: We support both SQL (.sql) and PySpark Notebook (.ipynb) output formats, making it easy to migrate to both traditional databases and Spark-based environments like Databricks.

Common Login Issues: Solutions for forgotten passwords, account lockouts, or email verification problems.

Conversion Errors: A guide to understanding and resolving common error messages.

Subscription Issues: How to check your credit balance and manage your plan.

Support: For direct assistance, you can reach our support team via email at support@hanacv2sql.com.

